    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>8-bit scalar kernel with four partial sums (one running sum serializes on add latency). Used instead of the gather kernels where <ref refid="structfaiss_1_1SIMDConfig_1afa3c432ca843e2fa759d77b9ae0a6788" kindref="member">SIMDConfig::scalar_gather</ref> is set. Both functions use the same per-code summation order (partial sum m % 4, tail into the first), so single-code and four-code results are bit-identical. SL as in <ref refid="structfaiss_1_1pq__code__distance_1_1PQCodeDistanceScalar" kindref="compound">PQCodeDistanceScalar</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
